{"logId": "3ec381d9-3c35-485c-8f91-a45a63923426", "result": {"layoutParsingResults": [{"prunedResult": {"page_count": null, "width": 1190, "height": 1684, "model_settings": {"use_doc_preprocessor": false, "use_layout_detection": true, "use_chart_recognition": false, "use_seal_recognition": false, "use_ocr_for_image_block": false, "format_block_content": false, "merge_layout_blocks": true, "markdown_ignore_labels": ["number", "footnote", "header", "header_image", "footer", "footer_image", "aside_text"], "return_layout_polygon_points": true}, "parsing_res_list": [{"block_label": "paragraph_title", "block_content": "考评奖励标准——休假", "block_bbox": [165, 140, 456, 173], "block_id": 0, "block_order": 1, "group_id": 0, "block_polygon_points": [[165.0, 140.0], [456.0, 140.0], [456.0, 173.0], [165.0, 173.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "一级【0~1分】：按照公司标准完成休假，保证休假安全和休假质量。（底线原则）", "block_bbox": [162, 214, 843, 241], "block_id": 1, "block_order": 2, "group_id": 1, "block_polygon_points": [[162.0, 214.0], [843.0, 214.0], [843.0, 241.0], [162.0, 241.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "- 本条释义：能够完成公司的休假标准，保证休假的安全和健康。", "block_bbox": [164, 261, 675, 286], "block_id": 2, "block_order": 3, "group_id": 2, "block_polygon_points": [[164.0, 261.0], [675.0, 261.0], [675.0, 286.0], [164.0, 286.0]]}, {"block_label": "paragraph_title", "block_content": "符合的行为：", "block_bbox": [165, 329, 284, 353], "block_id": 3, "block_order": 4, "group_id": 3, "block_polygon_points": [[165.0, 329.0], [284.0, 329.0], [284.0, 353.0], [165.0, 353.0]]}, {"block_label": "paragraph_title", "block_content": "1、按照公司休假标准完成休假", "block_bbox": [181, 369, 434, 392], "block_id": 4, "block_order": 5, "group_id": 4, "block_polygon_points": [[181.0, 369.0], [434.0, 369.0], [434.0, 392.0], [181.0, 392.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "（1）处助以上管理层：全年至少40天休假，每年至少安排一次20天长途休假（鼓励完成60天）", "block_bbox": [191, 398, 929, 424], "block_id": 5, "block_order": 6, "group_id": 5, "block_polygon_points": [[191.0, 398.0], [929.0, 398.0], [929.0, 424.0], [191.0, 424.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "（2）课长/课助：全年至少30天休假，每年至少安排一次15天长途休假（鼓励完成50天）", "block_bbox": [192, 429, 885, 455], "block_id": 6, "block_order": 7, "group_id": 6, "block_polygon_points": [[192.0, 429.0], [885.0, 429.0], [885.0, 455.0], [192.0, 455.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "（3）班长/员工：全年至少30天休假，每年至少安排一次10天长途休假（鼓励完成40天）", "block_bbox": [187, 460, 885, 485], "block_id": 7, "block_order": 8, "group_id": 7, "block_polygon_points": [[193.0, 460.0], [879.0, 460.0], [879.0, 484.0], [193.0, 484.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "备注：公司鼓励各部门、各班组完成标准之上更多的休假，可通过员工、班组、部门等为单位自行开展试点，保证工作量的前提下，提高工作效率，增加休假时间。", "block_bbox": [181, 490, 1013, 546], "block_id": 8, "block_order": 9, "group_id": 8, "block_polygon_points": [[181.0, 490.0], [1013.0, 490.0], [1013.0, 546.0], [181.0, 546.0]]}, {"block_label": "paragraph_title", "block_content": "2、保证休假安全", "block_bbox": [182, 553, 327, 576], "block_id": 9, "block_order": 10, "group_id": 9, "block_polygon_points": [[182.0, 553.0], [326.0, 553.0], [326.0, 575.0], [182.0, 575.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "（1）长途旅行前全面检查车辆安全状况", "block_bbox": [193, 583, 505, 607], "block_id": 10, "block_order": 11, "group_id": 10, "block_polygon_points": [[193.0, 583.0], [505.0, 583.0], [505.0, 607.0], [193.0, 607.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "（2）严格遵守交通规则，注意交通、餐饮、住宿、露营、健康、人身等各项安全", "block_bbox": [191, 613, 826, 638], "block_id": 11, "block_order": 12, "group_id": 11, "block_polygon_points": [[191.0, 613.0], [826.0, 613.0], [826.0, 638.0], [191.0, 638.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "（3）外出旅游时，不找非正规导游、旅行团等", "block_bbox": [193, 644, 559, 669], "block_id": 12, "block_order": 13, "group_id": 12, "block_polygon_points": [[193.0, 644.0], [559.0, 644.0], [559.0, 669.0], [193.0, 669.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "[86]", "block_bbox": [573, 716, 612, 739], "block_id": 13, "block_order": 14, "group_id": 13, "block_polygon_points": [[573.0, 716.0], [611.0, 716.0], [611.0, 738.0], [573.0, 738.0]]}, {"block_label": "paragraph_title", "block_content": "考评奖励标准——休假", "block_bbox": [202, 900, 493, 932], "block_id": 14, "block_order": 15, "group_id": 14, "block_polygon_points": [[202.0, 900.0], [493.0, 900.0], [493.0, 932.0], [202.0, 932.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "（4）不单独到存在安全隐患的景点游玩（无信号、迷失方向、野兽出没）", "block_bbox": [230, 975, 800, 1000], "block_id": 15, "block_order": 16, "group_id": 15, "block_polygon_points": [[230.0, 975.0], [800.0, 975.0], [800.0, 1000.0], [230.0, 1000.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "（5）藏区或出境旅行必须提前了解当地宗教信仰、风俗习惯及法律法规等", "block_bbox": [231, 1006, 811, 1031], "block_id": 16, "block_order": 17, "group_id": 16, "block_polygon_points": [[231.0, 1006.0], [811.0, 1006.0], [811.0, 1031.0], [231.0, 1031.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "（6）车辆无人看管时，禁止将行李、包等贵重物品放在车内", "block_bbox": [230, 1036, 706, 1062], "block_id": 17, "block_order": 18, "group_id": 17, "block_polygon_points": [[230.0, 1036.0], [706.0, 1036.0], [706.0, 1062.0], [230.0, 1062.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "（7）不与套近乎的陌生人接触，及时给对方明确的拒绝", "block_bbox": [231, 1067, 670, 1092], "block_id": 18, "block_order": 19, "group_id": 18, "block_polygon_points": [[231.0, 1067.0], [670.0, 1067.0], [670.0, 1092.0], [231.0, 1092.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "（8）野山游玩时，不追赶动物，不轻易触摸陌生的植物，不随意采摘和食用野生果实", "block_bbox": [231, 1097, 899, 1123], "block_id": 19, "block_order": 20, "group_id": 19, "block_polygon_points": [[231.0, 1097.0], [899.0, 1097.0], [899.0, 1123.0], [231.0, 1123.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "（9）不到非正规游泳场所游泳", "block_bbox": [231, 1128, 471, 1153], "block_id": 20, "block_order": 21, "group_id": 20, "block_polygon_points": [[231.0, 1128.0], [471.0, 1128.0], [471.0, 1153.0], [231.0, 1153.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "（10）同业态店助以上同级高管休假外出不同乘一辆车、飞机", "block_bbox": [230, 1159, 715, 1184], "block_id": 21, "block_order": 22, "group_id": 21, "block_polygon_points": [[230.0, 1159.0], [715.0, 1159.0], [715.0, 1184.0], [230.0, 1184.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "3、合理地规划好休假，有良好的休假质量（行程安排轻松合理，不赶时间、不赶行程）", "block_bbox": [219, 1189, 907, 1215], "block_id": 22, "block_order": 23, "group_id": 22, "block_polygon_points": [[219.0, 1189.0], [907.0, 1189.0], [907.0, 1215.0], [219.0, 1215.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "4、购买旅游保险、意外保险（长途旅行购买旅行保险、意外保险，员工保额不低于100万，管理层保额不低于200万）", "block_bbox": [219, 1220, 1049, 1275], "block_id": 23, "block_order": 24, "group_id": 23, "block_polygon_points": [[219.0, 1220.0], [1049.0, 1220.0], [1049.0, 1275.0], [219.0, 1275.0]]}, {"block_label": "number", "block_content": "[87]", "block_bbox": [611, 1476, 650, 1499], "block_id": 24, "block_order": null, "group_id": 24, "block_polygon_points": [[611.0, 1476.0], [649.0, 1476.0], [649.0, 1498.0], [611.0, 1498.0]]}], "layout_det_res": {"boxes": [{"cls_id": 17, "label": "paragraph_title", "score": 0.8215931057929993, "coordinate": [165, 140, 456, 173], "order": 1, "polygon_points": [[165.0, 140.0], [456.0, 140.0], [456.0, 173.0], [165.0, 173.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.47168928384780884, "coordinate": [162, 214, 843, 241], "order": 2, "polygon_points": [[162.0, 214.0], [843.0, 214.0], [843.0, 241.0], [162.0, 241.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.8145852088928223, "coordinate": [164, 261, 675, 286], "order": 3, "polygon_points": [[164.0, 261.0], [675.0, 261.0], [675.0, 286.0], [164.0, 286.0]]}, {"cls_id": 17, "label": "paragraph_title", "score": 0.7404823899269104, "coordinate": [165, 329, 284, 353], "order": 4, "polygon_points": [[165.0, 329.0], [284.0, 329.0], [284.0, 353.0], [165.0, 353.0]]}, {"cls_id": 17, "label": "paragraph_title", "score": 0.5444800853729248, "coordinate": [181, 369, 434, 392], "order": 5, "polygon_points": [[181.0, 369.0], [434.0, 369.0], [434.0, 392.0], [181.0, 392.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "sco